 / 40.2 in</td>\n<td>73 cm / 28.7 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 3XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>85-95 kg / 187.4-209.4 lbs</td>\n<td>175-188 cm / 68.9-74 in</td>\n<td>118 cm / 46.5 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>54.5 cm / 21.5 in</td>\n<td>118 cm / 46.5 in</td>\n<td>106 cm / 41.7 in</td>\n<td>75 cm / 29.5 in</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Father 4XL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>95-105 kg / 209.4-231.5 lbs</td>\n<td>180-190 cm / 70.9-74.8 in</td>\n<td>122 cm / 48 in</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>55.5 cm / 21.9 in</td>\n<td>122 cm / 48 in</td>\n<td>110 cm / 43.3 in</td>\n<td>77 cm / 30.3 in</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<p>Blue Gingham Picnic keeps the whole family coordinated without making every outfit identical. The blue gingham top-and-skirt look gives moms and girls a breezy photo-ready shape, while the white tee-and-shorts set keeps dads and boys relaxed and easy to style.</p>\n\n<p>The supplied chart supports two shopper-facing Type choices, so this draft keeps the skirt set and shorts set separate in the picker. Every listed size is backed by a row from the attached vendor chart; adult 3XL and 4XL are listed for the shorts set only because the chart does not show skirt lengths for those rows.</p>\n\n<h3>Key Features:</h3>\n\n<ul>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Four-role matching:</strong> Includes girl, boy, mother, and father rows from the attached chart.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Blue gingham coordination:</strong> A crisp checked pattern keeps the family look bright and picnic-ready.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Two Type choices:</strong> Select Top &amp; Skirt Set or T-Shirt &amp; Shorts Set before choosing size.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Sunny-day styling:</strong> Lightweight silhouettes are suited to vacations, warm-weather photos, and casual family outings.</li>\n\n<li>\n<strong>Draft-only review:</strong> Created unpublished so merchandising can confirm fabric and stock details before launch.</li>\n\n</ul>\n\n<p>Choose each family member's Type and Size to build a coordinated blue gingham look for the next sunny memory.</p>",
